Subject: [PATCH] ARM: s3c64xx: Delete unnecessary assignment for the field
 "owner"
Message-ID: <8e027e26-730d-789b-0d3a-11712447479d@users.sourceforge.net>
To: linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
List-Id: linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org

From: Markus Elfring <elfring@users.sourceforge.net>
